cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this living review, please cite it as below."
title: "UnLost Literature Review: reading papyri, Herculaneum and virtual unwrapping"
abstract: >-
  A PRISMA 2020 living literature review for the UnLost project on
  reading papyri, the Herculaneum papyri, and virtual unwrapping. The repository
  hosts the pipeline that discovers, deduplicates, screens, and extracts
  data from the literature, and a companion Jekyll website that renders
  the current corpus, PRISMA flow, and change log.
type: dataset
